OL,3,ASupreme Court rejects Trump's request
OL,4,Ato stop California counting disputed
OL,5,Avotes
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo lower courts had already rejected
OL,8,Fthe request. State election officials
OL,9,Fhad questioned the federal government's
OL,10,Fclaims - saying the process used to
OL,11,Fidentify alleged non-citizens was
OL,12,Finaccurate.
OL,14,FThe Monday ruling comes on the eve of
OL,15,Fthe midterms, which will determine
OL,16,Fwhich political party controls the US
OL,17,FCongress for the last two years of
OL,18,FPresident Donald Trump's second term.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
