OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AThousands of European troops to
OL,4,Arehearse Ukraine deployment in event of
OL,5,Apeace
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut there are still more questions than
OL,8,Fanswers as to how such a military force
OL,9,Fmight work in practice. Western
OL,10,Fofficials stress that any force sent to
OL,11,FUkraine would not take part in
OL,12,Foffensive operations or be involved in
OL,13,Fpeacekeeping or ceasefire monitoring
OL,14,Fmissions.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
